---
import BaseHead from '../../components/BaseHead.astro';
import Header from '../../components/Header.astro';
import Footer from '../../components/Footer.astro';
import { SITE_TITLE, PHONE, PHONE_TEL } from '../../consts';
---

<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
	<BaseHead title={`Fixture Installation | ${SITE_TITLE}`} description="Professional installation of toilets, faucets, sinks, showers, and garbage disposals in Yucaipa, CA." />
</head>
<body>
	<Header />

	<section class="page-hero">
		<div class="container">
			<h1>Fixture Installation</h1>
			<p>Toilets, faucets, sinks, showers, and disposals installed right the first time.</p>
		</div>
	</section>

	<section class="content">
		<div class="container">
			<div class="content-grid">
				<div>
					<h2>What We Install</h2>
					<p>Whether you are upgrading a bathroom, replacing a failed fixture, or finishing a remodel, we install fixtures correctly and to code.</p>
					<ul>
						<li>Toilets (standard, comfort-height, dual-flush)</li>
						<li>Faucets and shower valves</li>
						<li>Kitchen and bathroom sinks</li>
						<li>Garbage disposals</li>
						<li>Shower and tub fixtures</li>
						<li>Bidets and specialty fixtures</li>
					</ul>
					
					<h3>What to Expect</h3>
					<ul>
						<li>Proper shutoff and isolation of water</li>
						<li>Correct mounting, sealing, and connections</li>
						<li>Leak testing after installation</li>
						<li>Cleanup and brief walkthrough</li>
					</ul>
				</div>
				<div>
					<h3>Why Professional Installation Matters</h3>
					<p>Improper installation can cause leaks, voids manufacturer warranties, and lead to water damage. We follow manufacturer guidelines and local plumbing codes so your new fixtures perform as intended.</p>
					
					<h3>Supply or Customer-Provided</h3>
					<p>You can supply the fixtures or we can help source quality options that fit your budget and style. Either way, we install them carefully and leave the job clean.</p>
					
					<div class="mt-2">
						<a href="/contact/" class="btn btn-primary">Request Installation Quote</a>
					</div>
				</div>
			</div>
		</div>
	</section>

	<section class="cta">
		<div class="container">
			<h2>Ready for New Fixtures?</h2>
			<p>Call today for a free, no-obligation installation estimate.</p>
			<a href={`tel:${PHONE_TEL}`} class="btn btn-primary">Call {PHONE}</a>
		</div>
	</section>

	<Footer />
</body>
</html>
